Ciao Yilin,

Have a look at the function ftM2graphNEL in the graph package.
For example

 From <- c("A","A","C","C")
To   <- c("B","C","B","D")
L    <- cbind(From,To)

W  <- 1:4
G1 <- ftM2graphNEL(L, W, edgemode="directed")

More info is in the man page.

