From rgentlem at fhcrc.org  Wed May 18 15:49:00 2005
From: rgentlem at fhcrc.org (Robert Gentleman)
Date: Wed May 18 15:49:25 2005
Subject: [BioC] Re: Sequence alignment for DNA sequences (John Zhang)
