Application forms and further details on eligibility for the BBSRC Training Development Scheme can be obtained either by writing to the Human Resources Department, John Innes Centre, Norwich Research Park, Colney, Norwich, NR4 7UH, UK or from our web site http://www.jic.ac.uk/corporate/opportunities/vacancies/index.htm 

The closing date for completed application forms will be 10 June 2005. Please quote post reference number 14 64 on all correspondence.     

