From KiplingD at cardiff.ac.uk  Thu May 26 09:33:39 2005
From: KiplingD at cardiff.ac.uk (David Kipling)
Date: Thu May 26 09:33:50 2005
Subject: [BioC] how to normalize by columns
In-Reply-To: <429568D9.1050308@yahoo.com.ar>
References: <429568D9.1050308@yahoo.com.ar>
